WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.133 --> 00:00:03.267
-In yet another
stunning development,

00:00:03.267 --> 00:00:04.767
the committee investigating
the coup attempt

00:00:04.767 --> 00:00:07.200
on January 6th
deposed Ginni Thomas,

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:09.534
the spouse of a sitting
Supreme Court justice,

00:00:09.534 --> 00:00:11.367
as more video evidence emerged

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:14.400
of another Trump ally,
Roger Stone, discussing plans

00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:16.067
before the election
to declare victory

00:00:16.067 --> 00:00:17.901
and overturn the results
if Trump lost.

00:00:17.901 --> 00:00:20.234
For more on this,
it's time for A Closer Look.

00:00:20.234 --> 00:00:24.000
♪♪

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.367
There was a huge development in
the congressional investigation

00:00:27.367 --> 00:00:29.200
of the January 6th
insurrection today,

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.100
when the committee
investigating the attack

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:34.501
took the unprecedented step
of deposing the spouse

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:36.300
of a sitting
Supreme Court justice.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.334
-Happening today here
in Washington, Ginni Thomas,

00:00:38.334 --> 00:00:40.434
the wife of the Supreme Court
justice Clarence Thomas,

00:00:40.434 --> 00:00:42.534
is meeting with
the January 6th Committee.

00:00:42.534 --> 00:00:45.601
-We know that members want to
talk to her about text messages

00:00:45.601 --> 00:00:47.100
she exchanged
with Mark Meadows,

00:00:47.100 --> 00:00:48.634
the former White House
Chief of Staff,

00:00:48.634 --> 00:00:50.667
about efforts
to overturn the election.

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:54.100
-She also texted with
Trump's then Chief of Staff,

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:55.734
Mark Meadows,
after the election,

00:00:55.734 --> 00:00:59.901
pressing him not to concede
to Joe Biden.

00:00:59.901 --> 00:01:01.501
-That's right --
Ginni Thomas,

00:01:01.501 --> 00:01:03.567
the wife
of Justice Clarence Thomas,

00:01:03.567 --> 00:01:05.701
was texting Donald Trump's
Chief of Staff,

00:01:05.701 --> 00:01:07.367
urging him not to concede.

00:01:07.367 --> 00:01:10.033
I feel like that's not
what the framers had in mind

00:01:10.033 --> 00:01:12.300
when they imagined separate but
equal branches of government.

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:14.100
I'm just guessing here,
but I'm going to assume

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:17.400
Martha Washington wasn't writing
secret letters by candle light

00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:20.267
to the first Chief Justice,
John Jay -- history fact.

00:01:20.267 --> 00:01:23.567
I'm guessing she wasn't
writing him letters on parchment

00:01:23.567 --> 00:01:25.133
that said,
"John Adams is a moron.

00:01:25.133 --> 00:01:27.567
Don't let him win
the election of 1796

00:01:27.567 --> 00:01:29.501
or they'll make a miniseries
about him one day

00:01:29.501 --> 00:01:30.934
starring Paul Giamatti.

00:01:30.934 --> 00:01:33.534
Yeah, the guy from 'Billions'!"

00:01:33.534 --> 00:01:35.434
I'm no legal expert,

00:01:35.434 --> 00:01:37.267
but I feel like
if you're the spouse

00:01:37.267 --> 00:01:39.000
of a sitting
Supreme Court justice,

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:41.734
you shouldn't be texting
anyone in the government

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:43.868
about anything,
let alone a coup.

00:01:43.868 --> 00:01:47.067
That'd be like if I found out
my wife was texting James Corden

00:01:47.067 --> 00:01:49.868
about how great
his monologue was last night.

00:01:49.868 --> 00:01:51.234
And then I'd confront her
and I'd say,

00:01:51.234 --> 00:01:52.801
"But he's on
at the same time as me."

00:01:52.801 --> 00:01:56.033
And she'd say,
"Wait, you're on at 12:30?"

00:01:56.033 --> 00:01:57.801
And then I'd say,
"Actually, it's 12:37,

00:01:57.801 --> 00:01:59.000
and please don't ask me why,

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.367
because the network won't
explain it to me either."

00:02:02.367 --> 00:02:04.133
And by the way,
those clips are underselling

00:02:04.133 --> 00:02:05.400
what Ginni was actually doing.

00:02:05.400 --> 00:02:07.334
She wasn't just texting
Trump's Chief of Staff

00:02:07.334 --> 00:02:09.167
and urging Trump not to concede.

00:02:09.167 --> 00:02:10.601
She had direct communications

00:02:10.601 --> 00:02:12.801
with state lawmakers
in Arizona and Wisconsin,

00:02:12.801 --> 00:02:15.868
pressuring them --
again, as the spouse

00:02:15.868 --> 00:02:17.501
of a sitting
Supreme Court justice --

00:02:17.501 --> 00:02:19.033
to overturn Biden's victory.

00:02:19.033 --> 00:02:20.467
And she was also texting

00:02:20.467 --> 00:02:23.234
some truly bat[bleep]
conspiracy theories

00:02:23.234 --> 00:02:24.934
from the craziest corners
of the Internet --

00:02:24.934 --> 00:02:27.767
stuff I had honestly
never even heard about

00:02:27.767 --> 00:02:29.767
until the Ginni Thomas story
broke.

00:02:29.767 --> 00:02:32.300
-The Washington Post obtained
copies of messages

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:34.934
that had been turned over
to the January 6th committee

00:02:34.934 --> 00:02:36.801
revealing that Ginni Thomas sent

00:02:36.801 --> 00:02:38.667
former Trump Chief of Staff
Mark Meadows

00:02:38.667 --> 00:02:40.434
a barrage of texts

00:02:40.434 --> 00:02:43.033
in the weeks after
the 2020 election,

00:02:43.033 --> 00:02:45.801
urging him to try
to overturn the results.

00:02:45.801 --> 00:02:48.767
She referred to wild
far-right conspiracy theories,

00:02:48.767 --> 00:02:51.767
sending Meadows a link
to an absolutely,

00:02:51.767 --> 00:02:54.667
just insane YouTube video
that's since been taken down

00:02:54.667 --> 00:02:57.534
which was centered around
a fake QAnon conspiracy theory.

00:02:57.534 --> 00:02:59.701
After she texted
that video to Meadows,

00:02:59.701 --> 00:03:02.267
Thomas added,
"I hope this is true."

00:03:02.267 --> 00:03:04.567
-Right after the election,
she quoted to Meadows

00:03:04.567 --> 00:03:07.567
the language then circulating
on pro-Trump sites,

00:03:07.567 --> 00:03:12.200
"Biden crime family and
ballot fraud co-conspirators

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:15.767
(elected officials, bureaucrats,
social media censorship mongers,

00:03:15.767 --> 00:03:18.234
fake stream media reporters,
etc)

00:03:18.234 --> 00:03:22.133
are being arrested and detained
for ballot fraud right now

00:03:22.133 --> 00:03:26.133
&amp; over coming days, &amp; will be
living in barges off GITMO

00:03:26.133 --> 00:03:28.701
to face military tribunals
for sedition,"

00:03:28.701 --> 00:03:30.934
adding, "I hope this is true."

00:03:30.934 --> 00:03:33.734
-You know, it almost --
almost -- makes me feel bad

00:03:33.734 --> 00:03:34.701
for Clarence Thomas.

00:03:34.701 --> 00:03:36.467
I mean, we all know a couple

00:03:36.467 --> 00:03:38.133
that has to leave
every party early

00:03:38.133 --> 00:03:40.167
because one spouse
decided to pre-game

00:03:40.167 --> 00:03:43.200
with back pills and Everclear,
and 20 minutes in,

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:46.033
they're loudly describing
some foot problem they have.

00:03:46.033 --> 00:03:50.033
"Yeah, it's turning green.
It's about to fall off.

00:03:50.033 --> 00:03:52.934
Now, who wants to dance?"

00:03:52.934 --> 00:03:54.868
But think about
how insane that is.

00:03:54.868 --> 00:03:57.167
Ginni Thomas didn't just think
the election was stolen.

00:03:57.167 --> 00:04:01.000
She thought Joe Biden
and the "Biden crime family"

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:04.968
would be arrested
and living on barges off Gitmo.

00:04:04.968 --> 00:04:07.400
And here's my question --

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:13.267
Why a barge off Gitmo
instead of just Gitmo itself?

00:04:13.267 --> 00:04:15.834
Let's just assume
for the sake of the argument

00:04:15.834 --> 00:04:17.801
that all the crazy [bleep]
she was texting

00:04:17.801 --> 00:04:19.801
turned out to be true --
that Hugo Chávez teamed up

00:04:19.801 --> 00:04:21.567
with the CIA
and Dominion voting machines

00:04:21.567 --> 00:04:23.067
to rig the election
using ballots

00:04:23.067 --> 00:04:25.100
smuggled in from China
covered in bamboo fibers,

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:26.601
but then Trump caught them

00:04:26.601 --> 00:04:28.400
by secretly watermarking
the real ballots

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:30.033
and then conducted
a sting operation

00:04:30.033 --> 00:04:31.367
to arrest the Biden crime family

00:04:31.367 --> 00:04:33.567
and prove that the election was,
in fact, stolen.

00:04:33.567 --> 00:04:36.834
Let's just assume for a moment
that all of that is true,

00:04:36.834 --> 00:04:41.567
and, whoa, whoa,
I see why they're into this!

00:04:41.567 --> 00:04:44.100
Wh-- It's like being
on Molly and Mountain Dew

00:04:44.100 --> 00:04:46.901
at the same time.

00:04:46.901 --> 00:04:48.501
Whoa.

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:52.667
[ Laughter ]

00:04:52.667 --> 00:04:56.534
Okay, if all of that is true,
why would the military

00:04:56.534 --> 00:05:02.601
go to all the extra trouble of
building a barge off Gitmo

00:05:02.601 --> 00:05:04.200
when they already have Gitmo?

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:06.701
That's what Gitmo is for.

00:05:06.701 --> 00:05:08.901
Is the assumption
that Biden can't swim,

00:05:08.901 --> 00:05:10.100
so he'd never escape?

00:05:10.100 --> 00:05:12.400
Because he does seem like
one of those old dudes

00:05:12.400 --> 00:05:14.067
who would just strip down
and jump in the lake

00:05:14.067 --> 00:05:15.868
no matter how cold it was.

00:05:15.868 --> 00:05:19.167
"Grandpa, the water's freezing."
"Come on in.

00:05:19.167 --> 00:05:21.901
It'll put some hair
on your chest."

00:05:21.901 --> 00:05:25.167
Seriously?
Why a barge off the prison?

00:05:25.167 --> 00:05:29.300
Have they ever done that with
any other criminal suspect ever?

00:05:29.300 --> 00:05:31.300
Alright, we caught
the River City Strangler.

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:32.667
Should we put him
in Alcatraz?

00:05:32.667 --> 00:05:37.501
Nah, for a guy that bad, he goes
on the Alcatraz catamaran.

00:05:37.501 --> 00:05:41.467
[ Laughter ]

00:05:41.467 --> 00:05:43.934
And in case all of this
isn't weird enough for you,

00:05:43.934 --> 00:05:46.200
Thomas made her appearance today
even weirder

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:48.868
when she arrived
and a reporter caught up to her

00:05:48.868 --> 00:05:50.534
and tried to ask her questions.

00:05:50.534 --> 00:05:51.968
-Ms. Thomas, why do you feel
like you need

00:05:51.968 --> 00:05:56.234
to speak to the committee
to clear your name?

00:05:56.234 --> 00:05:57.701
-Thank you for being here.

00:05:57.701 --> 00:05:59.300
-Did you speak with your husband

00:05:59.300 --> 00:06:02.901
about your beliefs
of the election being stolen?

00:06:02.901 --> 00:06:04.367
-Thank you for your question.

00:06:04.367 --> 00:06:06.701
Look forward
to answering the members.

00:06:06.701 --> 00:06:10.734
-[ Laughing ] Oh!
What is going on here?

00:06:10.734 --> 00:06:16.267
Is this one of those promotions
for that new movie "Smile"?

00:06:16.267 --> 00:06:19.934
If you only -- If you had only
been communicating

00:06:19.934 --> 00:06:21.434
with Ginni Thomas via text

00:06:21.434 --> 00:06:24.367
and this was the first time
you saw her face, you'd think,

00:06:24.367 --> 00:06:26.667
"Oh, no.

00:06:26.667 --> 00:06:29.834
Oh, that lady was crazy
the whole time.

00:06:29.834 --> 00:06:32.868
Oh, no!

00:06:32.868 --> 00:06:36.667
I texted her
about government stuff."

00:06:36.667 --> 00:06:38.367
So, Thomas' texts were insane.

00:06:38.367 --> 00:06:39.567
But in a way,
they weren't shocking

00:06:39.567 --> 00:06:41.234
because, as we've said
many times before,

00:06:41.234 --> 00:06:43.067
Trump surrounds himself
with a group of people

00:06:43.067 --> 00:06:45.100
who are, in addition
to being very dangerous

00:06:45.100 --> 00:06:47.367
and deeply corrupt,
also just incredibly weird.

00:06:47.367 --> 00:06:49.767
As a New York City
real-estate mogul,

00:06:49.767 --> 00:06:51.000
Trump could have had his pick

00:06:51.000 --> 00:06:52.667
of sophisticated
white-collar criminals.

00:06:52.667 --> 00:06:55.033
Instead, he assembled
a team of mutants

00:06:55.033 --> 00:06:57.300
who failed
their X-Men auditions.

00:06:57.300 --> 00:06:59.734
"There's Pillow Man.
His pillows may be soft,

00:06:59.734 --> 00:07:03.300
but his voice is loud enough
to shatter glass.

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:04.601
There's Former Mayor.

00:07:04.601 --> 00:07:08.033
He can pull the skin all the way
back behind his head.

00:07:08.033 --> 00:07:09.868
Not sure what good
that's going to do,

00:07:09.868 --> 00:07:12.267
but it's cool
to watch him do it.

00:07:12.267 --> 00:07:14.734
Then there's Roger,
the time-traveling drug dealer.

00:07:14.734 --> 00:07:17.868
You know, he's the one who gave
Sherlock Holmes all that opium."

00:07:17.868 --> 00:07:20.934
Now, we'll get to
the newest developments

00:07:20.934 --> 00:07:23.667
involving Trump confidant
Roger Stone in a second.

00:07:23.667 --> 00:07:26.601
But first, let's start with
My Pillow CEO Mike Lindell,

00:07:26.601 --> 00:07:28.133
because, you know, why not?

00:07:28.133 --> 00:07:30.167
Lindell had his phone seized
by the FBI

00:07:30.167 --> 00:07:31.868
while he was
in a Hardee's drive-through

00:07:31.868 --> 00:07:33.534
as part of an investigation

00:07:33.534 --> 00:07:35.467
into a voting-machine breach
in Colorado

00:07:35.467 --> 00:07:36.968
that he may have
been connected to.

00:07:36.968 --> 00:07:40.901
And now he's complaining that
his new phone has nothing on it

00:07:40.901 --> 00:07:44.667
because he didn't back up any
of the data on his old phone.

00:07:44.667 --> 00:07:47.701
-I don't use a laptop.
I don't use a computer.

00:07:47.701 --> 00:07:49.300
Everything was on that phone.

00:07:49.300 --> 00:07:51.367
One of the things --
there were files on that phone

00:07:51.367 --> 00:07:54.767
that you can't get through
the cloud that were passwords.

00:07:54.767 --> 00:07:56.234
Some of them passwords
were so --

00:07:56.234 --> 00:08:00.067
I wire money from different
accounts back and forth.

00:08:00.067 --> 00:08:02.767
And I have to look those
passwords up in those files.

00:08:02.767 --> 00:08:05.467
I can't get to those, Steve.
I can't get anything.

00:08:05.467 --> 00:08:07.334
I took the number
and transferred it

00:08:07.334 --> 00:08:11.234
from my carrier
to another phone,

00:08:11.234 --> 00:08:12.267
but the phone is blank.

00:08:12.267 --> 00:08:13.834
It's missing all these things.

00:08:13.834 --> 00:08:16.300
We -- This phone --
Like I said, Steve,

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:19.133
I would've rather --
almost rather they arrested me

00:08:19.133 --> 00:08:20.334
than took my phone.

00:08:20.334 --> 00:08:25.234
-I bet he offered that to
the FBI and they said no.

00:08:25.234 --> 00:08:27.701
"Just take me with you!"
"No, we're good."

00:08:27.701 --> 00:08:29.701
"Please!
Everything was on that phone,

00:08:29.701 --> 00:08:31.000
including my address,

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:33.701
so I don't know how to
get home without it.

00:08:33.701 --> 00:08:35.234
Just let me come sleep with you

00:08:35.234 --> 00:08:38.067
and sleep in jail behind --
oh, bars."

00:08:38.067 --> 00:08:41.634
Also, Mike, every time
you defend yourself,

00:08:41.634 --> 00:08:44.300
you seem to describe
a different potential crime

00:08:44.300 --> 00:08:45.334
you maybe committed.

00:08:45.334 --> 00:08:49.000
Why are you wiring money
back and forth

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:50.801
between different accounts
all the time?

00:08:50.801 --> 00:08:53.167
"I'm always moving money around
in an effort

00:08:53.167 --> 00:08:55.601
to make it look like
I got enough to cover my debts.

00:08:55.601 --> 00:08:59.300
And now I can't --
Things are about to get bad."

00:08:59.300 --> 00:09:01.901
For some reason, these doinks
are always on camera

00:09:01.901 --> 00:09:05.033
complaining about something
extremely weird, like Rudy,

00:09:05.033 --> 00:09:06.701
who recently went on his podcast

00:09:06.701 --> 00:09:08.934
to insist once again that
the election was stolen

00:09:08.934 --> 00:09:12.701
and also complained that no one
was inviting him on TV anymore.

00:09:12.701 --> 00:09:16.100
-They're lying about
January 6th.

00:09:16.100 --> 00:09:19.934
They're trying to make alternate
electors look like a crime.

00:09:19.934 --> 00:09:22.634
There's nothing wrong with it.
It was absolutely in the open.

00:09:22.634 --> 00:09:24.534
There was no fraud
attached to it.

00:09:24.534 --> 00:09:29.400
They want us ignored.
They want us put in prison.

00:09:29.400 --> 00:09:31.467
They want all our property
taken from us.

00:09:31.467 --> 00:09:34.100
They don't want us
to be allowed to be employed.

00:09:34.100 --> 00:09:39.200
And they don't want any
television station to put us on.

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:41.100
And they say so.

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:44.100
And the television stations
comply.

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:45.300
That's not fascism?

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:48.601
-No, it's not.
I don't...

00:09:48.601 --> 00:09:50.934
I don't think it's fascism
so much as not wanting

00:09:50.934 --> 00:09:53.667
to scare the children at home.

00:09:53.667 --> 00:09:55.868
I mean, this should come with
a content warning.

00:09:55.868 --> 00:09:57.734
This looks like one of
those photos they used for

00:09:57.734 --> 00:10:00.834
the Surgeon General's warning
on a pack of cigarettes.

00:10:00.834 --> 00:10:02.200
Also, can we go back to this?

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:04.467
-They don't want us to be
allowed to be employed.

00:10:04.467 --> 00:10:08.133
-Who's "us"?
They don't want you employed.

00:10:08.133 --> 00:10:10.133
And you shouldn't be employed.
You're 78.

00:10:10.133 --> 00:10:12.701
You should be retired
and enjoying your golden years,

00:10:12.701 --> 00:10:16.467
just playing golf
in your JNCO shorts.

00:10:16.467 --> 00:10:17.968
Look at those shorts.

00:10:17.968 --> 00:10:20.000
[ Laughter ]

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:21.801
I've never seen shorts that big

00:10:21.801 --> 00:10:24.901
that didn't also have
a wallet chain.

00:10:24.901 --> 00:10:28.701
[ Laughter ]

00:10:28.701 --> 00:10:30.300
And then there's Roger Stone,

00:10:30.300 --> 00:10:33.901
the Fourth Horseman
of the Weird-ocalypse.

00:10:33.901 --> 00:10:36.167
Stone's been a long-time
confidant of Donald Trump.

00:10:36.167 --> 00:10:38.267
And we told you yesterday,
the January 6th Committee

00:10:38.267 --> 00:10:40.167
has also obtained
damning new footage

00:10:40.167 --> 00:10:41.934
of Stone explaining
the Trump team's plan

00:10:41.934 --> 00:10:43.901
to steal the election
to a documentary film crew.

00:10:43.901 --> 00:10:45.334
For example, in one clip,

00:10:45.334 --> 00:10:48.534
he just straight up says,
before the results are in,

00:10:48.534 --> 00:10:50.834
that if the outcome
isn't clear right away,

00:10:50.834 --> 00:10:53.000
the Trump team will just
claim victory anyway.

00:10:53.000 --> 00:10:54.400
-Let's just hope
we're celebrating.

00:10:54.400 --> 00:10:55.567
-[ Laughs ]
-Oh, I know.

00:10:55.567 --> 00:10:57.667
-I suspect it'll be --
I really do suspect

00:10:57.667 --> 00:10:59.601
it will still be up in the air.

00:10:59.601 --> 00:11:03.100
When that happens, the key thing
to do is to claim victory.

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:04.601
Possession is 9/10s of the law.

00:11:04.601 --> 00:11:06.267
"No, we won. [Bleep] you.
Sorry. Over.

00:11:06.267 --> 00:11:08.501
We won. You're wrong.
[Bleep] you."

00:11:08.501 --> 00:11:09.968
-He thinks he's
a criminal mastermind,

00:11:09.968 --> 00:11:11.267
but he talks like
your father-in-law

00:11:11.267 --> 00:11:12.434
over a game of Pictionary.

00:11:12.434 --> 00:11:14.367
"No. [Bleep] you.
We won. I drew --

00:11:14.367 --> 00:11:15.968
No. [Bleep] you.

00:11:15.968 --> 00:11:18.667
I drew a way better pickle than
you, and Sarah said, 'Pickle.'

00:11:18.667 --> 00:11:19.667
Tell them, Sarah."

00:11:19.667 --> 00:11:22.067
"Actually,
I said, 'Microphone.'"

00:11:22.067 --> 00:11:26.434
"Oh, my God, Sarah.

00:11:26.434 --> 00:11:27.634
You're on your mother's side
now, Sarah?

00:11:27.634 --> 00:11:28.534
[Bleep] you too."

00:11:28.534 --> 00:11:29.834
[ Laughter ]

00:11:29.834 --> 00:11:31.901
It's both dangerous
and also incredibly pathetic.

00:11:31.901 --> 00:11:33.901
I mean, seriously,
can you imagine

00:11:33.901 --> 00:11:36.067
these four in a room together?

00:11:36.067 --> 00:11:38.834
"We won. [Bleep] you."
"My phone is blank."

00:11:38.834 --> 00:11:44.400
"Oof! I sat on my balls."
"Thank you for being here.

00:11:44.400 --> 00:11:46.534
Thank you for being here."

00:11:46.534 --> 00:11:50.033
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:11:50.033 --> 00:11:52.767
That -- You guys, that was very
exciting, what you just saw.

00:11:52.767 --> 00:11:54.834
[ Laughter ]

00:11:54.834 --> 00:11:57.067
That was rehearsal
for my new one-man show,

00:11:57.067 --> 00:11:58.934
"Waiting for Go-D'oh."

00:11:58.934 --> 00:12:01.000
[ Laughter ]

00:12:06.467 --> 00:12:08.367
Ginni Thomas
is just the latest example,

00:12:08.367 --> 00:12:10.033
but she is by no means
the only one.

00:12:10.033 --> 00:12:11.367
Trump's gang,

00:12:11.367 --> 00:12:13.367
and virtually the entirety of
the Republican Party,

00:12:13.367 --> 00:12:15.367
have, like, bought into a series

00:12:15.367 --> 00:12:17.534
of increasingly deranged
conspiracy theories,

00:12:17.534 --> 00:12:20.067
and they were so devoted
to those insane theories

00:12:20.067 --> 00:12:22.000
that they actually took
the very real steps

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:24.200
to overturn the election --
steps they laid out

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:27.901
in highly specific detail
in text messages and e-mails,

00:12:27.901 --> 00:12:31.067
or on camera
over and over and over again.

00:12:31.067 --> 00:12:32.834
There are so many
different stories.

00:12:32.834 --> 00:12:35.167
The committee has to interview
so many different people

00:12:35.167 --> 00:12:36.234
so they can go through...

00:12:36.234 --> 00:12:37.934
-Different accounts
back and forth.

00:12:37.934 --> 00:12:42.067
[ Laughter ]

00:12:42.067 --> 00:12:44.300
-This has been --
Well, yeah, look.

00:12:44.300 --> 00:12:46.934
Just remember how good
the one-man show was.

00:12:46.934 --> 00:12:48.300
This has been A Closer Look.

